We will present two studies that both use exploratory factor analyses to approach these questions. We will then re ne these analyses in a third step, computing con rmatory factor analyses to reach a parsimonious presence scale.
5 Study 1
To address the goals outlined above, we conducted a survey study on presence and immersion experiences. The survey combined questions from previously published questionnaires, and from our own past research with newly designed questions. Study 1 was conducted to collect data on both immersion and presence experiences and to explore possible factors inside the concepts.

